      "title": "Gatwick airport to open second runway after legal challenge fails",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/aug/04/gatwick-airport-second-runway-legal-challenge-fails",
      "description": "<p>£2.2bn project will allow about 100,000 more flights a year to use Britain’s second busiest airport</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/live/2026/aug/04/oil-profits-spike-middle-east-war-energy-prices-donald-trump-business-live-economy-latest-news-updates\">Business live – latest updates</a></p></li></ul><p>Gatwick airport is to start development of its second runway after campaigners lost a legal challenge to the plans.</p><p>The court of appeal on Tuesday dismissed a bid by local campaign groups to challenge an earlier high court ruling that the scheme could proceed.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/aug/04/gatwick-airport-second-runway-legal-challenge-fails\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
